  "name": "Scholar",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your scholarly efforts bear fruit. While studying magic, you also specialized in an academic field of study. Choose one of the following skills: Arcana, History, Investigation, Medicine, Nature, or Religion. Your gain Proficiency in the chosen skill. If you are already proficient in the skill, you add double your Proficiency bonus to checks you make with it.</p>",
